\subsection{Motor Identification under Common Configurations}
A retrospective subset retains speed, load, phase-flag, and stored phase-severity tuples represented for both attacked motors: 596 tuples and 8,841 attack windows (4,475 ACIM; 4,366 PMSM). Each tuple occurs for both classes, so these metadata do not uniquely identify the attacked motor.

